WEBVTT

00:15:27.912 --> 00:15:30.654
He looked and talked exactly
like what I wanted,

00:15:30.678 --> 00:15:33.812
and immediately, he scored 850 points.

00:15:33.836 --> 00:15:35.500
It was enough for a date.

00:15:35.524 --> 00:15:37.616
Three weeks later, we met up in person

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:41.120
for what turned out to be
a 14-hour-long conversation

00:15:41.144 --> 00:15:43.191
that went from coffee shop to restaurant

00:15:43.215 --> 00:15:45.372
to another coffee shop
to another restaurant,

00:15:45.396 --> 00:15:47.920
and when he dropped me back off
at my house that night

00:15:47.944 --> 00:15:49.095
I re-scored him --

00:15:49.119 --> 00:15:50.285
[1,050 points!]

00:15:50.309 --> 00:15:51.582
Thought, you know what,

00:15:51.606 --> 00:15:54.166
this entire time,
I haven't been picky enough.

00:15:54.849 --> 00:15:56.555
Well, a year and a half after that,

00:15:56.579 --> 00:15:59.102
we were non-cruise ship traveling

00:15:59.126 --> 00:16:01.187
through Petra, Jordan,